Probably not in full. Under the current conditions of carriage (terms-2026-08), a vehicle booking cancelled at least 24 hours before departure gets a full refund. Cancelling less than 24 hours before departure gets a 50 per cent refund.

So if your sailing is more than 24 hours after the time you cancel, you get everything back. If you cancel the day before, it depends on the exact departure time: cancel 24 hours or more ahead for a full refund, but anything inside 24 hours is 50 per cent.
